    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She notices my stricken face and attempts a half-hearted smile. “What are you in for?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1584
        },
        {
          "text": "There are several possible reasons, but like hell am I going to share any of them with her. “Um,” I say noncommittally i",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1669
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yeah,” she replies, sighing. “Same.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1795
        },
        {
          "text": "I somehow doubt that’s true. “I’m sorry,” I say. To my surprise, I find I mean it",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1829
        }
